guard: The guard steps into your path, hand on their weapon. "This area's restricted. State your business."
- I'm trying to save someone. Please, let me through.
	[signal arg="NPC3_talk"]
	guard: ...Fine. Go quickly, before I think better of this.
- Move. Or I make you.
	[signal arg="NPC3_attack"]
	guard: *Their hand tightens on the weapon.* Wrong answer.